and geographic inequality (y-axis: Gini coefficient of accessibility). The top-right quadrant represents the ideal state (high efficiency, low inequality). Bubble size is 
proportional to the absolute number of patients in each country experiencing critical access shortages (E2SFCA < 0.25).
