5. Conclusion
Inconclusion,ourresultsindicatethatintracranialdeliveryofDlin-
MC3-DMA LNPs results in the development of a protein corona which
differs from that of intravenously administered particles, due to the
acquisitionofsite-specificproteincoronas.Weshowthatthechangein
proteincoronaaffectsthecellularuptakekineticsofLNPsaswellastheir
ability to effectively deliver cargo, while importantly, the increased
uptakeofLNPsdoesnotguaranteemoreefficienttargetknockdown.
