-3′(forward) and 5′- GTCTCTTCTTCCCTAGGAGCG -3′(reverse); CXCL3, 
5′- CGCCCAAACCGAAGTCATAG -3′(forward) and 5′- 
GCTCCCCTTGTTCAGTATCTTTT -3′(reverse); CXCL5, 5′- 
AGCTGCGTTGCGTTTGTTTAC -3′(forward) and 5′-TGGCGAA-
CACTTGCAGATTAC -3′(reverse); CXCL6, 5′-AGAGCTGCGTTG-
CACTTGTT -3′(forward) and 5′-GCAGTTTACCAATCGTTTTGGGG -3′ 
(reverse); CXCL7, 5′-GTAACAGTGCGAGACCACTTC -3′(forward) and 5′- 
CTTTGCCTTTCGCCAAGTTTC -3′(reverse); CXCL8, 5′-TTTTGCCAAG-
