(reverse); Gapdh, 5′- CATCACTGCCACCCAGAAGACTG -3′(forward) and 
5′- ATGCCAGTGAGCTTCCCGTTCAG -3′(reverse); Tgfb1, 5′- CCACCTG-
CAAGACCATCGAC -3′(forward) and 5′- CTGGCGAGCCTTAGTTTGGAC 
-3′(reverse); Cxcl1, 5′- CTGGGATTCACCTCAAGAACATC -3′(forward) 
and 5′- CAGGGTCAAGGCAAGCCTC -3′(reverse); Cxcl2, 5′- CCAAC-
CACCAGGCTACAGG -3′(forward) and 5′- GCGTCACACTCAAGCTCTG 
