MUC1-C Is a Common Driver of Acquired
Osimertinib Resistance in NSCLC
Naoki Haratake, MD, PhD, a Hiroki Ozawa, MD, PhD, a Y oshihiro Morimoto, MD, PhD,a
Nami Yamashita, MD, PhD, a T atsuaki Daimon, MD, PhD,a
Atrayee Bhattacharya, PhD, a Keyi Wang, MD, a Ayako Nakashoji, MD, PhD, a
