T omoyoshi T akenaka, MD, PhD,e T omoharu Y oshizumi, MD, PhD,e
T etsuya Mitsudomi, MD, PhD,g Aaron N. Hata, MD, PhD, b Donald Kufe, MD a,*
aDepartment of Medical Oncology , Dana-Farber Cancer Institute Harvard Medical School, Boston, Massachusetts
bDepartment of Medicine, Massachusetts General Hospital and Harvard Medical School, Boston, Massachusetts
cDepartment of Biostatistics, Graduate School of Medicine, Yamaguchi University , Yamaguchi, Japan
dDivision of Bioinformatics, Medical Institute of Bioregulation, Kyushu University , Fukuoka, Japan
