2.7.2.1. Compressive strength of bio-bricks. The bio-brick's compressive 
strength was obtained via universal testing machine (UTM) as per IS 
3495: Part 1: 2019 and as per the previously reported protocol.57 The 
brick was placed in UTM to evaluate its compressive strength at 7 N/ 
mm2 which was calculated by the following eq. 1. 
