enhanced compressive strength and physicochemical properties
S. Roopanjali a,b,*, S. Lakshmi c, Shah Faseeh ul Ameen Mehdi a, Syed Zeeshan a, K. Manju d,  
S. Niranjan Raj d, Ravikumara d, T.K. Pavan d, Syed Baker d,*
