were significant predictors of CD (all P < 0.001). IL-23 produced the 
largest OR (28.18; 95% CI 18.27–44.38), followed by IL-6 (24.81; 95% 
CI 17.33–36.92). CAR, CRP, the LBP/albumin ratio and LBP yielded 
