"1-s2.0-S1877782124001723-main.pdf","Global burden of lung cancer in 2022 and projections to 2050: Incidence 
and mortality estimates from GLOBOCAN
Jialin Zhou a,c, Ying Xu a,c, Jianmin Liu b,c, Lili Feng a,c, Jinming Yu a,c,*,  
Dawei Chen a,c,*
a Shandong University Cancer Center, Jinan, Shandong, China
b Shandong Second Medical University, Weifang, Shandong, China
c Shandong Provincial Key Laboratory of Precision Oncology, Jinan, Shandong, China; Shandong Cancer Hospital and Institute, Shandong First Medical University and 
