Impact of radiotherapy on secondary lung cancer risk and survival in
elderly female breast cancer survivors
Jieming Lua,b,1
 , Zhimin Shena,b,c,d,e,1, Xiaoqing Wanga,b, Yanhong Lina,b,
Ziyang Hana,b,c,d,e,*, Mingqiang Kanga,b,c,d,e,*
a Department of Thoracic Surgery, Fujian Medical University Union Hospital, China
b Key Laboratory of Cardio-Thoracic Surgery (Fujian Medical University), China
c Key Laboratory of Gastrointestinal Cancer (Fujian Medical University), Ministry of Education, China
d Fujian Key Laboratory of Tumor Microbiology, Department of Medical Microbiology, Fujian Medical University, China
