percholesterolemia.8,49 The VERVE-101 trial, part of the heart-1
clinical trial, has presented results for 10 patients who received
an infusion of VERVE-101.191 6/10 patients were administered
sub-therapeutic doses (0.1 mg/kg, n = 3 and 0.3 mg/kg, n = 3),
