of WT cells (p < 0.001), which was also reﬂected by average
growth rates of 4.6-fold over 96 h ( Figures 4J and 4K). Notably,
LNCaPRB1/C0//C0;TP53/C0//C0cells also expressed signiﬁcantly higher
