plates, which were allowed to solidify at 37 ◦C for 15 min. Organoids 
were cultured in Advanced DMEM/F12 supplemented with N2, B27, 
HEPES, N-acetylcysteine, EGF, FGF2, R-spondin 1, Noggin, and Y- 
27632, with medium refreshed every 2–3 days. Cultures were passaged 
every 7–10 days via mechanical dissociation and re-embedding in 
Matrigel, and maintained at 37 ◦C in a 5 % CO2 incubator.
BODIPY C11 Staining for Lipid Peroxidation: Organoids were treated 
with vehicle (DMSO, 72 h), 25 μM NR2 (72 h), or 10 μM Ferrostatin-1 
(Fer-1, 2 h pretreatment) followed by co-incubation with 25 μM NR2 
(72 h). After treatment, organoids were stained with 5 μM BODIPY 581/ 
