observed that SPW-2 bricks (SF: SPW = 70 %: 30 %) exhibited the highest strength, irrespective of the number of cycles. The
SPW-2 bricks recorded an optimum strength of 38.14 MPa. Whereas compressive strength of 33.25 MPa and 29.45 MPa were
