The proportion of pores in the micropores decreased as the
modulus of the alkali activator increased, whereas the pro-
portion of the pores in mesopores and macropores increased
(Fig. 16 (d)). The polymerization reaction of GGBS decreased
owing to the increase in soluble Si caused by the increase in
the modulus, which coated the surface of the slag with silicon
and prevented the dissolution of Al and Ca. The increase in the
