and S9). Additionally, the lung depositions of coumarin 6-labeled n-PN 
and DiR dye-labeled p-LP were visualized using fluorescence imaging of 
(i) the whole body including intact lungs of live mice and (ii) the excised 
lungs from sacrificed mice (Fig. 5D and S7). Notably, the same pattern 
