cancer-causing agent is known as a carcinogen. There are the following 
agents. Physical agent - Betal, Smoking, Drinking, Tobacco and Biolog-
ical agent ␀ 1- Parasite - Schistosoma parasite cause cancer 2- Viruses - 
Hepatitis B&C causes Liver cancer. Cancer-causing viruses are known as 
oncogenic viruses—radiation - X-ray, Gama ray, UV ray, Nuclear bomb 
[12].
