The Survival Advantage of Lobectomy over Wedge
Resection Lessens as Health-Related Life
Expectancy Decreases
Michelle C. Salazar , MD,a,b Maureen E. Canavan, PhD, c,d Samantha L. Walters, BS, d
Sitaram Chilakamarry , MD,e Theresa Ermer , MD,f Justin D. Blasberg, MD, d
James B. Yu, MD, MHS, g Cary P . Gross, MD,b,c,h Daniel J. Boffa, MD d,*
