bNational Clinician Scholars Program, Yale University School of Medicine, New Haven, Connecticut
cCancer Outcomes Public Policy and Effectiveness Research (COPPER) Center , Department of Internal Medicine, Yale
University School of Medicine, New Haven, Connecticut
dSection of Thoracic Surgery , Department of Surgery , Yale University School of Medicine, New Haven, Connecticut
