(bliu@mednet.ucla.edu).
Materials availability
All unique/stable reagents generated in this study are available from thelead contact with a completed Materials Transfer Agreement.
Data and code availability
d Single-cell RNA-seq data have been deposited at GEO and are publicly available as of the date of publication. Accession num-
ber is listed in the key resource table . TCGA data were downloaded from the UCSC Xena Data Portal.
