In brief
Using three orthogonal spatially resolved
molecular proﬁling technologies, Wu
et al. identiﬁed two groups of lung
adenocarcinomas with distinct patterns
of geographic diversiﬁcation. They found
that these two groups differed in their
survival outcomes and found evidence
suggesting that the observed patterns
may be linked to differences in tumor cell
motility.
