As shown in Figure 2 (highlighted in green), this full methodology targets the training set. The validation set undergoes
subflow generation using the same class-specific factors ( 𝑎𝑐) derived from training statistics. We strictly exclude
oversampling to preserve original class proportions, ensuring unbiased evaluation on a representative distribution of
