Feed-Forward
 
Neural
 
Network
 
(FFN):
 
 
•
 
The
 
feed-forward
 
neural
 
network
 
consists
 
of
 
two
 
linear
 
transformations
 
with
 
a
 
non-linear
 
activation
 
function
 
in
 
between.
 
It
 
is
 
calculated
 
using
 
Equation
 
2.
 
 
•
 
It
 
introduces
 
non-linearities
 
to
 
the
 
output
 
of
 
