space baseline, K ADAPTreduces the alarm p99 delay from
0.398 ms to 0.345 ms, which is a 13.3% improvement (median-
of-3). The K ADAPTp99 remains close to the no-enforcement
baseline (0.348 ms), indicating that adaptive rate control pro-
tects tail behavior avoiding overhead that dominates latency.
