tuned for the aquatic domain, and an LTE/MQTT fleet link with
RTK-GPS time synchronization. We report on the system’s vali-
dation across two distinct deployments: an 18-vessel Swan Lake
interpretation at Lake Zurich and an 8-vessel Time Space Exis-
tence 2025 Venice Biennale demonstration at Forte Marghera,
establishing a foundational reference for the design and deploy-
ment of fluidic robotic swarms.
