of instances and poorly with minority classes. Nonetheless, the confusion matrix in figure 3 demonstrates
that despite DoS achieving an F1-score of 1, the model still misclassifies 2574 instances as Brute Force,

Infection, Network Scanning, and Normal traffic. This indicates that even the class with many instances
