1. INTRODUCTION
ML models (e.g., Decision Tree (DT), Rule-Based DT) to compare with the pro-
posed DL architectures (e.g., CNN, TCN, and Residual Temporal Convolutional
Network (Res-TCN)). Following the comparative evaluation, the proposed archi-
