the server.
4.5.3.6 Payload Size (p size)
This feature represents the payload size, in bytes, of the data transmitted by H-
IoT devices in the network. The payload size is extracted from the log line using
a regular expression, a pattern-matching technique that locates the size value in
the ‘Payload’ section. In this dataset, the payload size remains constant at 512
bytes.
