consistently delivers data. This is due to MQTT’s structured design, which en-
sures orderly message flow, and its reliable delivery mechanisms guarantee mes-
sage delivery even in unstable network conditions.
Despite these differences, both datasets highlight the TCN model’s capability
and versatility in detecting DDoS attacks. The slight differences in performance
demonstrate the model’s ability to adapt to different network protocols and attack
scenarios.
