These malicious nodes are integrated into the topology used in the baseline
scenario to construct the attack model. As a result, a unified simulation setup
is created with malicious and non-malicious nodes, where three sophisticated
attacks, SF, MITM, and DDoS, are executed within the same H-IoT topology.
This setup enables the collection of both normal and malicious traffic data within
