Each ML and DL model differs in type, depth, and architectural complex-
ity. The effect of model capacity is evaluated using a DT [13] model on the
proposed UL-ECE-MultiAttack-H-IoT2025 dataset. The simplest configuration
(max depth = 1) represents a shallow tree with limited capacity and correspond-
ingly reduced accuracy, reflecting underfitting. Increasing the depth to two
(max depth = 2) introduces moderate capacity and markedly improves gener-
alisation and accuracy. At a depth of three (max depth = 3), the DT achieves
100% accuracy on the test set, indicating that it has fully captured the dataset’s
