A. Evaluation of GPS tracking system
An experiment was initiated to verify the accuracy of the
neo6m GPS module in producing GPS location information.
The longitude and latitude information provided by Google
Maps for a specific location was compared with the location
data produced by the Neo 6m GPS module for the same
location, serving as the basis for evaluating our GPS-based
tracking system.
