V. CONCLUSION
This work demonstrates that combining FL with LLM-
driven reasoning enables a practical, scalable, and fully au-
tonomous Zero Trust defense for IoT environments, capa-
ble of detecting, interpreting, and mitigating threats. The
proposed framework demonstrates that Zero Trust security
can be effectively implemented in IoT environments by in-
tegrating FL, LLM-based threat intelligence, and automated
enforcement into a unified pipeline. The federated autoen-
coder achieved perfect recall across all evaluated attacks while
preserving data privacy by training exclusively on local device
data. The fine-tuned LLM successfully translates anomalies
into accurate, actionable security decisions with automated
response without human intervention.
