generation, cluster formation, intra-cluster consensus, and final synthesis. In practice, many of these
phases execute in parallel, and cluster sizes remain small, yielding efficient end-to-end execution.
Our design thus achieves the adaptability and flexibility promised by dynamic task decomposition
and multi-agent collaboration.
