The network topology consists of 78 IoT devices using mulDple applicaDon protocols, including MQTT , 
CoAP , and RTSP . MQTT devices generate moderate network traﬃc, while CoAP devices produce smaller 
volumes of traﬃc. In contrast, RTSP devices like  IP Camera Museum exhibit signiﬁcantly higher 
