The model achieved an accuracy of 89%, as depicted in Table 4. This high accuracy demonstrates the 
model's ability to eﬀecDvely diﬀerenDate between benign and malicious traﬃc, even in the context of 
an FL environment with diverse IoT devices. Nonetheless, the model also exhibited some classiﬁcaDon 
errors, which suggest areas for further improvement, parDcularly in handling speciﬁc a]ack types or 
device-speciﬁc characterisDcs. 
To facilitate reproducibility, we provide Jupyter Notebooks in the repository that demonstrate how to 
use the dataset here. These notebooks can be executed in a Google Colab environment and cover data 
loading, preprocessing, and model training to help researchers extend and reﬁne our approach.  
