To guarantee that the iVeg dashboard functions as a dependable, real-
time reflection of the fleet’s cognitive state, the underlying ROS 2–
MQTT–FIWARE communication infrastructure was subjected to a rig-
orous latency profiling analysis under live greenhouse operating condi-
