a fundamental requirement. The empirical temporal data logged dur-
ing active in-field navigation are systematically decomposed in Table 5.
This breakdown isolates the transport latency (∆t1: edge serialization
to the MQTT broker) from the cloud orchestration latency (∆t2: bro-
