IV. DISCUSSION
This pre-clinical evaluation confirms that theVRxBioRe-
laxsystem reliably delivers real-time EMG biofeedback
within a virtual reality environment, adhering to stringent
latency and signal quality standards. With a median end-
to-end latency of 20.5 ms and 98% of frames processed
under 45 ms, the system operates well below commonly
accepted perceptual thresholds for interactive biofeedback
and VR applications. These results provide strong evidence
that our implementation is technically suitable for intero-
ceptive training, muscle relaxation, and future therapeutic
