This secret is used as the key for symmetric ChaCha20-Poly1305 encryption [22].
6.3 Temporal Reputation Decay
Reputation score𝑅 decays naturally back toward neutral reputation𝑅0=0.5 as a function of elapsed time
to allow rehabilitated nodes to recover from temporary failures:
𝑅(𝑡)=𝑅 0+(𝑅(𝑡 0)−𝑅 0)·𝑒 −𝜆(𝑡−𝑡 0) (10)
where𝜆is set to a half-life of 29 days (9.6×10 −7 s−1).
7 Mechatronics Case Study: Factory Floor Automation
To validate the real-world utility of TIP in mechatronics engineering, we model a complete water bottle
manufacturing line. The factory floor comprises diverse hardware, ranging from low-power microcontroller
sensors to industrial PLCs.
