impact on radio resources and requested data rates.
The SADR assesses the DT results to determine if the
configuration meets requirements or if UEs data rates need
adjustment. The minimum reward safety threshold for UEs
is based on scenarios with moderate traffic, helping prevent
outages by adjusting packet transmission historically.
