1 INTRODUCTION
Internet of things (IoT) deployments have witnessed a rapid growth
among domains ranging from home and industrial automation to
agriculture and healthcare [37, 50]. Thousands of IoT devices (eg.
sensors and actuators) are produced everyday [28, 48], and in their
