5.4 Key Exchange
The decryption key establishment occurs when the end device re-
ceives the request from remote user asking for permission to access
one of the sensor values. Here we introduce TLS-like methods over
MQTT-SN to establish the key exchange. The user needs to publish
a request asking for authorization with the data decryption key of
a specific URI. We define the topic that the user should publish the
request to as theRequest Payloadshown in table 4. All of the domain
