using DR0 and on 500 kHz channels amongst the 8 500kHz channels defined using DR4. The 696 
end-device SHALL change channels for every transmission.  697 
For rapid network acquisition in mixed gateway channel plan environments, the device 698 
SHOULD follow a random channel selection sequence that efficiently probes the octet groups 699 
of eight 125 kHz channels , followed by probing one 500 kHz channel on each pass. Each 700 
consecutive pass SHOULD NOT select a channel that was used in a previous pass, until a 701 
Join-Request is transmitted on every channel, after which the entire process can restart.  702 
