The EU433 channel plan of LoRaWAN implements an OPTIONAL CFList of 16 octets in the 877 
Join-Accept message. 878 
In this case, the CFList is a list of five channel frequencies for the channels three to seven , 879 
whereby each frequency is encoded as a 24-bit unsigned integer (three octets). All these 880 
channels are usable for DR0 to DR5 125 kHz LoRa modulation. The list of frequencies is 881 
followed by a single CFListType octet for a total of 16 octets. The CFListType SHALL be 882 
equal to zero (0) to indicate that the CFList contains a list of frequencies. 883 
