The AU915-928 band SHALL be divided into the following channel plans: 939 
• Upstream – 64 channels, numbered 0 to 63, utilizing LoRa 125 kHz BW, varying from 940 
DR0 to DR5, using coding rate 4/5, starting at 915.2 MHz and incrementing linearly by 941 
200 kHz to 927.8 MHz 942 
