4.3.1.6 Frame options (FOptsLen in FCtrl, FOpts) 719 
The frame-options length field (FOptsLen) in FCtrl denotes the actual length of the frame 720 
options field (FOpts) included in the frame.   721 
FOpts transports MAC commands of a maximum length of 15 octets that are piggybacked 722 
