• TLS_RSA_WITH_AES_256_CBC_SHA256 (x00, 3D) 
• TLS_RSA_WITH_AES_128_GCM_SHA256 (x00, x9C) 
• TLS_RSA_WITH_AES_256_GCM_SHA384 (x00, x9D) 
See transition guidance in SP 800-131A [10] for information on deprecation timelines.

