threat types (Section 3.4.4) and vulnerabilities (Section 3.4.5). These risks are offered in terms relating to 
the healthcare environment, and similar risks can be expected in a typical healthcare environment. Note 
that the likelihood of threats and vulnerabilities would be based on having implemented effective 
controls, which would also affect the level of risk determined. 
