 User accounts for remote access are set up and linked to profiles 
set for each remote user who needs to access the PACS servers. 
 Symantec VIP Enterprise Gateway is installed and integrated with 
ConsoleWorks by using the RADIUS connection. 
 To supplement standard username/password logins on a variety of 
servers and services, the VIP Access mobile phone application is 
