To verify the two-factor authentication using username/password with 
a VIP token 
1. Use a browser to connect to the TDi console: 
(https://192.168.1.4:5176). 
2. Open the VIP Access mobile phone application. It should display a 
security code with a valid time duration. 
3. Log in to the TDi console with username/password followed by the 
VIP security token found in the mobile phone application. 
To verify that the user can access only the granted resources 
