without a 2FA token should fail with the message “Invalid User 
Credentials.”  
 Logging in to the TDi console with a valid username/password with 
valid 2FA token should be successful. 
 Authenticated user should have access to the list of approved 
graphical connections and should be able to connect to these 
servers. 
Actual Results 
Using a pre-created Hyland user as an example, the first attempt to log 
in to the TDi console with only a username and password failed. The 
second attempt to log in, this time with a 2FA token, was successful. 
