2.1.2 DCM4CHEE 
DCM4CHEE is a collection of open-source applications that communicate with each other using DICOM 
and HL7 standards for clinical image management and archival. In this study, DCM4CHEE listens for 
connection requests from specific application entities like DVTk’s Modality Emulator to receive patient 
