2.7.5 Forescout CounterACT 8 
Forescout CounterACT is a network access control tool that can perform device discovery and 
classification, risk assessment, and control automation through passive and active techniques. For this 
project, the intended use of Forescout is to manage device compliance and perform necessary 
remediation when devices fall out of compliance. 
System Requirements 
 CPUs: 2 
 Memory: 8 GB RAM 
