2.8 Endpoint Protection and Security 
Endpoint protection and security measures are deployed to workstation end points to further 
emphasize defense in depth. The build includes an agent-based endpoint protection solution that is 
centrally managed within the enterprise. Endpoint protection provides anti-malware features with 
centralized servers assuring that managed assets receive regular updates. 
