11. Check if the Device ID field captures the device serial number, 
22334455, associated with Janelle Kouma. 
 
Verify that data from the RPM devices are being sent to Accuhealth 
and associated with the correct patient. 
12. For the following devices, turn on each device and follow the 
provided instructions to take a measurement: 
a. blood pressure monitor 
b. blood glucose monitoring system 
c. digital scale 
