Actual Results Once LogRhythmXDR was configured to provide user activity 
monitoring and file integrity monitoring, we began by testing the user 
activity monitoring. For this test, we powered on the Windows Server 
in the Clinical Workstations VLAN that had been configured with a 
LogRhythm System Monitor Agent. We made five consecutive login 
attempts using an invalid password, which was then detected by 
LogRhythm, and an alert was created that was visible on the 
