Next, we tested the file integrity monitoring. For this test, we logged 
in to the Windows Server in the Clinical Workstations VLAN and made 
some modifications to the testfile text document in the 
C:\\testdirectory folder. Once the changes had been saved, an alarm 
was triggered and visible in the LogRhythm Web Console. From the 
alert, we could also drill down to the event and determine what user 
had made the modification. 
