10. Under LogSource of the System Monitor Agent Property window, right-click in the empty space 
and select New. The Log Message Source Property window will open. 
11. Under the Log Message Source Property window, click the button associated with Log Message 
Source Type. It will open the Log Source Selector window. 
12. In the text box to the right of the Log Source Selector window, type XML, and click Apply. 
13. Select the Log Source Type and click OK. 
 
