2.1.8 TDi ConsoleWorks External Remote Access 
The NCCoE lab implemented a VendorNet using TDi ConsoleWorks, which is a browser interface that 
enables healthcare delivery organizations (HDOs) to manage, monitor, and record activities from 
external vendors in the IT infrastructure. 
