provide intrusion prevention and detection on endpoint devices; the database is used for storing the 
policies, agent information, and real-time actionable events; and the SVA provides agentless anti-
malware protection for VMware guest VMs running Windows. 
The management server and the console can be installed on one system, and the agents are generally 
