2.5.3.3 Risk Assessment 
We created a risk assessment for each device by responding to the MDRAP’s built-in questionnaire. The 
basic steps of creating a risk assessment for a given device are listed below. 
1. On the Welcome to MDRAP page (Figure 2-27 above), click Assessments on the menu bar, or 
click the Go to Assessments link on the page. 
2. On the Create Assessment page (Part 1: Figure 2-33), select a device. 
3. On the Create Assessment page (Part 2: Figure 2-34), select the questionnaire type (i.e., MDISS 
Questionnaire).

