2.1 Structure of an MQTT Control Packet 384 
The MQTT protocol operates by exchanging a series of MQTT Control Packets in a defined way. This 385 
section describes the format of these packets.  386 
 387 
An MQTT Control Packet consists of up to three parts, always in the following order as shown below.  388 
