3.1.2 CONNECT Variable Header 548 
The Variable Header for the CONNECT Packet contains the following fields in this order: Protocol Name, 549 
Protocol Level, Connect Flags, Keep Alive, and Properties. The rules for encoding Properties are 550 
described in section 2.2.2. 551 
