If the Will Flag is set to 1, the Will Properties is the next field in the Payload. The Will Properties field 930 
defines the Application Message properties to be sent with the Will Message when it is published, and 931 
properties which define when to publish the Will Message. The Will Properties consists of a Property 932 
Length and the Properties. 933 
