Non-normative comment 1065 
If the Will Delay Interval of the existing Network Connection is 0 and there is a Will Me ssage, it 1066 
will be sent because the Network Connection is closed. If the Session Expiry Interval of the 1067 
existing Network Connection is 0, or the new Network Connection has Clean Start set to 1 then if 1068

