2. The Server MUST perform the processing of Clean Start that is described in section 3.1.2.4 1072 
[MQTT-3.1.4-4]. 1073 
 1074 
3. The Server MUST acknowledge the CONNECT packet with a CONNACK packet containing a 1075 
0x00 (Success) Reason Code [MQTT-3.1.4-5]. 1076 
