a Client. The Server MUST send a CONNACK with a 0x00 (Success) Reason Code before sending any 1111 
Packet other than AUTH [MQTT-3.2.0-1]. The Server MUST NOT send more than one CONNACK in a 1112 
Network Connection [MQTT-3.2.0-2]. 1113 
