3.8.3 SUBSCRIBE Payload 2111 
The Payload of a SUBSCRIBE packet contains a list of Topic Filters indicating the Topics to which the 2112 
Client wants to subscribe. The Topic Filters MUST be a UTF-8 Encoded String [MQTT-3.8.3-1]. Each 2113 
