4.1.1 Storing Session State 2718 
The Client and Server MUST NOT discard the Session State while the Network Connection is open 2719 
[MQTT-4.1.0-1]. The Server MUST discard the Session State when the Network Connection is closed and 2720 
the Session Expiry Interval has passed [MQTT-4.1.0-2]. 2721 
