By default, a Server MUST treat every Topic as an Ordered Topic when it is forwarding messages on 2915 
Non-shared Subscriptions. [MQTT-4.6.0-6]. A Server MAY provide an administrative or other mechanism 2916 
to allow one or more Topics to not be treated as an Ordered Topic. 2917 
