- Connect Reason Code or in section 3.14.2.1 – Disconnect Reason Code. There are no consequences 3480 
for other Sessions. 3481 
 3482 
If either the Server or Client omits to check some feature of an MQTT Control Packet, it might fail to 3483 
detect an error, consequently it might allow data to be damaged. 3484 
