This ﬁeld indicates the maximum message size supported by the link endpoint. Any attempt to
deliver a message larger than this results in a message-size-exceeded link-error. If this ﬁeld is
zero or unset, there is no maximum size imposed by the link endpoint.
offered-capabilities the extension capabilities the sender supports
A registry of commonly deﬁned link capabilities and their meanings is maintained [AMQ-
PLINKCAP].
desired-capabilities the extension capabilities the sender can use if the receiver supports them
The sender MUST NOT attempt to use any capability other than those it has declared in desired-
capabilities ﬁeld.
properties link properties
The properties map contains a set of ﬁelds intended to indicate information about the link and its
container.
