+->| AVAILABLE |
| +------------+
| |
| |
terminal outcome: | |
RELEASED/MODIFIED | | TRANSFER (acquiring)
| |
| |
| \\|/
| +------------+
+--| ACQUIRED |
+------------+
|
|
| terminal outcome:
| ACCEPTED/REJECTED
|
|
\\|/
+------------+
| ARCHIVED |
+------------+
