is an error for the controller to attempt to discharge a transaction against which a partial delivery has been posted.
If this happens, the control link MUST be terminated with the transaction-rollback error.
The effect of transactional posting is that the message does not become available at the destination node within
the transactional resource until after the transaction has been successfully discharged.
