if the current window is the last one and the SCHC ACK indicates that all tiles were
correctly received, yet the integrity check was a failure, the fragment sender  send a
SCHC Sender-Abort, and it  exit with an error condition. 
if the current window is the last one and the SCHC ACK indicates that integrity checking
was successful, the sender exits successfully. 
on Retransmission Timer expiration:
if Attempts is strictly less that MAX_ACK_REQUESTS, the fragment sender  send a
SCHC ACK REQ and  increment the Attempts counter. 
otherwise, the fragment sender  send a SCHC Sender-Abort, and it  exit with an
error condition. 
At any time:
on receiving a SCHC Receiver-Abort, the fragment sender  exit with an error condition. 
on receiving a SCHC ACK that bears a W value diﬀerent from the W value that it currently
uses, the fragment sender  silently discard and ignore that SCHC ACK. 
