Constrained Application Protocol (CoAP) Hop-Limit
Option
Abstract
The presence of Constrained Application Protocol (CoAP) proxies may lead to inﬁnite forwarding
loops, which is undesirable. To prevent and detect such loops, this document speciﬁes the Hop-
Limit CoAP option.
