7.3. Example OSCORE Compression 
This section gives an example with a GET request and its consequent Content response from a
Device-based CoAP client to a cloud-based CoAP server. The example also describes a possible set
of Rules for Inner SCHC Compression and Outer SCHC Compression. A dump of the results and a
contrast between SCHC + OSCORE performance with SCHC + CoAP performance are also listed.
This example gives an approximation of the cost of security with SCHC-OSCORE.
