10.2. Generating the Initial SDP Oﬀer 
When the oﬀerer creates an initial oﬀer, the oﬀerer:
 associate an SDP ""setup"" attribute with the ""m="" line; 
 associate an SDP ""sctp-port"" attribute with the ""m="" line; 
, in the case of TCP/DTLS/SCTP, associate an SDP ""connection"" attribute, with a ""new""
attribute value, with the ""m="" line; and 
 associate an SDP ""max-message-size"" attribute (Section 6) with the ""m="" line. 
