An EKTCipher determines how the EKTCiphertext ﬁeld is written and how it is processed when it
is read. This ﬁeld is opaque to the other aspects of EKT processing. EKT Ciphers are free to use
this ﬁeld in any way, but they  use other EKT or SRTP ﬁelds as an input. The values
of the parameters L and T  be deﬁned by each EKTCipher. The cipher  provide
integrity protection.
