will need to have explicit aﬀordances for sending the ACK message in response to an EKTKey
message and for verifying that an ACK message was received. The retransmission rules for both
sides are otherwise deﬁned by the negotiated version of DTLS.
If an EKTKey message is received that cannot be processed, then the recipient  respond
with an appropriate DTLS alert.
