Abstract
This speciﬁcation provides a mechanism for a host that implements a routing-agnostic interface
based on IPv6 over Low-Power Wireless Personal Area Network (6LoWPAN) Neighbor Discovery
to obtain reachability services across a network that leverages RFC 6550 for its routing
operations. It updates RFCs 6550, 6775, and 8505.
