SRH-6LoRH before the RPI-6LoRH to transport the compressed address of the 6LR as the
destination address of the outer IPv6 header. In Figure 19 of , the destination IP of the
outer header was elided and was implicitly the same address as the destination of the inner
header. Type 1 was arbitrarily chosen, and the size of 0 denotes a single address in the SRH.
