10. Security Considerations 
This document describes the terminology, requirements, and an architecture for firmware
updates of IoT devices. The content of the document is thereby focused on improving the security
of IoT devices via firmware update mechanisms and informs the standardization of a manifest
format.
An in-depth examination of the security considerations of the architecture is presented in 
.
