Abstract
This document updates RFC 8138 by deﬁning a bit in the Routing Protocol for Low-Power and
Lossy Networks (RPL) Destination-Oriented Directed Acyclic Graph (DODAG) Conﬁguration
option to indicate whether compression is used within the RPL Instance and to specify the
behavior of nodes compliant with RFC 8138 when the bit is set and unset.
