5. Record Payload Protection 
Several types of ciphers have been deﬁned for use with TLS and DTLS, and the MAC calculations
for those ciphers diﬀer slightly.
This speciﬁcation modiﬁes the MAC calculation as deﬁned in  and , as well as
the deﬁnition of the additional data used with Authenticated Encryption with Associated Data
(AEAD) ciphers provided in , for records with content type tls12_cid. The modiﬁed
algorithm  be applied to records that do not carry a CID, i.e., records with content type
other than tls12_cid.
