"rfc_rfc_9151_commercial_national_security_algorithm_ff43b1d0.pdf","RFC 9151
Commercial National Security Algorithm (CNSA)
Suite Proﬁle for TLS and DTLS 1.2 and 1.3
Abstract
This document deﬁnes a base proﬁle for TLS protocol versions 1.2 and 1.3 as well as DTLS protocol
versions 1.2 and 1.3 for use with the US Commercial National Security Algorithm (CNSA) Suite.
The proﬁle applies to the capabilities, conﬁguration, and operation of all components of US
National Security Systems that use TLS or DTLS. It is also appropriate for all other US Government
systems that process high-value information.
The proﬁle is made publicly available here for use by developers and operators of these and any
other system deployments.
