RDs implementing this speciﬁcation  support the application/link-format  content
format (ct=40).
RDs implementing this speciﬁcation  support additional content formats.
Any additional content format supported by an RD implementing this speciﬁcation  be
able to express all the information expressible in link format. It  be able to express
information that is inexpressible in link format, but those expressions  be avoided where
possible.
