have a path component of its own and  be suitable as a base URI to resolve any
relative references given in the registration. The parameter is therefore usually of the shape
""scheme://authority"" for HTTP and CoAP URIs. The URI  have a query or
fragment component, as any non-empty relative part in a reference would remove those
parts from the resulting URI.
