Additional operations on the registration can be speciﬁed in future documents, for example:
Send iPATCH (or PATCH) updates  to add, remove, or change the links of a
registration. 
Use GET to read the currently stored set of links in a registration resource. 
Those operations are out of scope of this document and will require media types suitable for
modifying sets of links.
