The group is speciﬁed in the RD. The base parameter is set to the site-local multicast address
allocated to the group. In the POST in the example below, the resources supported by all group
members are published.
After the ﬁlling of the RD by the CT, the application in the luminaries can learn to which groups
they belong and enable their interface for the multicast address.
