similar to Figure 5. The group address in the example is constructed from the reserved 2001:db8::
preﬁx in  as a unicast-preﬁx-based site-local address (see ).
In this example, the group manager can easily permit devices that have no writable color-
temperature to join, as they would still respond to brightness-changing commands. Had the group
instead contained a single resource that sets brightness and color-temperature atomically,
endpoints would need to support both properties.
The resources of a group can be looked up like any other resource, and the group registrations
