Incomplete) and 2.31 (Continue) response codes are discussed in Section 7.2.
If a server receives payloads with diﬀerent Request-Tags for the same resource, it should continue
to process all the bodies, as it has no way of determining which is the latest version or which body,
if any, the client is terminating the transmission for.
