10.2.3. Handling MAX_PAYLOADS with Recovery 
Figure 9 shows an example of an Observe that is triggered but for which some notiﬁcation blocks
are lost. The client detects the missing blocks and requests their retransmission. It does so by
indicating the blocks that are missing as one or more Q-Block2 options.
