10.2.4. Handling Recovery by Setting the M Bit 
Figure 10 shows an example where an Observe is triggered but only the ﬁrst two notiﬁcation
blocks reach the client. In order to retrieve the missing blocks, the client sends a request with a
single Q-Block2 option with the M bit set.
