5.5. Client Credentials 
Authentication of the client is mandatory independent of the grant type when requesting an
access token from the token endpoint. In the case of the client credentials grant type, the
authentication and grant coincide.
Client registration and provisioning of client credentials to the client is out of scope for this
specification.
