Note: In this example, we are using a symmetric key for a multi-RS audience, which is not
recommended normally (see Section 6.9). However, in this case, the risk is deemed to be
acceptable, since all the doors are part of the same physical access control system; therefore, the
risk of a malicious RS impersonating the client towards another RS is low.
