Gerdes, et al. Standards Track Page 16

any time (e.g., because they have expired), the association may become useless at some point. A
resource server therefore  terminate existing DTLS association after the last access token
associated with this association has expired.
As specified in , the resource server  notify the client with an
error response with code 4.01 (Unauthorized) for any long-running request before terminating
the association.
