"rfc_rfc_9203_the_object_security_for_constrained_res_a8672c7c.pdf","RFC 9203
The Object Security for Constrained RESTful
Environments (OSCORE) Profile of the
Authentication and Authorization for Constrained
Environments (ACE) Framework
Abstract
This document specifies a profile for the Authentication and Authorization for Constrained
Environments (ACE) framework. It utilizes Object Security for Constrained RESTful
Environments (OSCORE) to provide communication security and proof-of-possession for a key
owned by the client and bound to an OAuth 2.0 access token.
