3. Client-AS Communication 
The following subsections describe the details of the POST request and response to the token
endpoint between the client and AS.  defines how to derive a security
context based on a shared Master Secret and a set of other parameters, established between the
client and server, which the client receives from the AS in this exchange. The PoP key included in
the response from the AS  be used as a Master Secret in OSCORE.
