Concise Problem Details for Constrained Application
Protocol (CoAP) APIs
Abstract
This document defines a concise ""problem detail"" as a way to carry machine-readable details of
errors in a Representational State Transfer (REST) response to avoid the need to define new error
response formats for REST APIs for constrained environments. The format is inspired by, but
intended to be more concise than, the problem details for HTTP APIs defined in RFC 7807.
