4.2. Cipher Suites for TLS 1.2 
Given the foregoing considerations, implementation and deployment of the following cipher
suites is :
TLS_ECDHE_RSA_WITH_AES_128_GCM_SHA256 
TLS_ECDHE_RSA_WITH_AES_256_GCM_SHA384 
TLS_ECDHE_ECDSA_WITH_AES_128_GCM_SHA256 
TLS_ECDHE_ECDSA_WITH_AES_256_GCM_SHA384 
As these are Authenticated Encryption with Associated Data (AEAD) algorithms , these
cipher suites are supported only in TLS 1.2 and not in earlier protocol versions.
Typically, to prefer these suites, the order of suites needs to be explicitly configured in server
software. It would be ideal if server software implementations were to prefer these suites by
default.
