some can be carried out remotely , e.g., as Rowhammer  variants. In
deployments where side-channel attacks and fault injection attacks are a concern,
implementation strategies combining both randomness and determinism (for example, as
described in ) can be used to avoid the risk of successful extraction of the
signing key.
