A YANG Data Model for Static Context Header
Compression (SCHC)
Abstract
This document describes a YANG data model for the Static Context Header Compression (SCHC)
compression and fragmentation Rules.
This document formalizes the description of the Rules for better interoperability between SCHC
instances either to exchange a set of Rules or to modify the parameters of some Rules.
