be used by the RS to determine the secret key it shares with the Client. The JWT is created as
explained in , and the JWT  include 
. If a CWT/COSE is used, this information  be inside the ""COSE_Key"" object and 
 be encrypted using a ""COSE_Encrypt0"" structure.
The AS returns error responses for JSON-based interactions following .
When CBOR is used, the interactions  implement the procedure described in 
