It is  that the Client implements TLS:Anon,MQTT:ace as the first choice when
working with protected topics. However, MQTT v3.1.1 Clients that do not prefer to overload the
User Name and Password fields for ACE (as described in Section 6)  implement
TLS:Known(RPK/PSK),MQTT:none and, consequently, TLS:Anon,MQTT:None to submit their token
