               |        |--T-|--M--| 1 |
               +--------+----+-----+---+~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
               | RuleID |DTag|  W  |C=1| padding as needed
               +--------+----+-----+---+~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
MAY
Figure 2: SCHC Compound ACK Message Format. Losses are found in windows W = w1,...,wi, where
w1 < w2 <...< wi. 
  |--- SCHC ACK Header --|- W=w1 -|...|---- W=wi -----|
         |--T-|---M--|-1-|        |...|---M--|        |---M--|
  +------+----+------+---+--------+...+------+--------+------+~~~~~+
  |RuleID|DTag| W=w1 |C=0| Bitmap |...| W=wi | Bitmap |00..00| pad |
  +------+----+------+---+--------+...+------+--------+------+~~~~~+
