usage or not of the Compressed Bitmap format in the last window of the SCHC Compound
ACK message. 
For each active pair of RuleID and DTag values, the sender  maintain:
one Attempts counter and 
one Retransmission Timer. 
For each active pair of RuleID and DTag values, the receiver  maintain:
one Attempts counter and 
one Inactivity Timer. 
