5.3. SCHC Abort Examples 
Case SCHC Sender-Abort
The sender may need to send a Sender-Abort to stop the current communication. For example,
this may happen if the All-1 has been sent MAX_ACK_REQUESTS times.
Case Receiver-Abort
The receiver may need to send a Receiver-Abort to stop the current communication. This
message can only be sent after a Downlink Enable.
