Manufacturer Usage Description (MUD) for TLS and
DTLS Profiles for Internet of Things (IoT) Devices
Abstract
This memo extends the Manufacturer Usage Description (MUD) specification to allow
manufacturers to define TLS and DTLS profile parameters. This allows a network security
service to identify unexpected (D)TLS usage, which can indicate the presence of unauthorized
software, malware, or security policy-violating traffic on an endpoint.
