4.1.2. Provisioning of Access Tokens to the RS
In accordance with the used transport profile of ACE (e.g., , , ), the
RS receives a piece of token-related information hereafter denoted as TOKEN_INFO.
In particular:
If the AS-to-Client response was encoded in CBOR, then TOKEN_INFO is the value of the
CBOR byte string conveyed by the 'access_token' parameter of that response. That is,
TOKEN_INFO is the binary representation of the access token.
