Note that:
If the access token is a JWT, then HASH_INPUT is the binary representation of the JWT.
If the access token is a CWT, then HASH_INPUT is the binary representation of a base64url-
encoded text string, which encodes the binary representation of a tagged access token with
the CWT as the innermost tag content (as per Section 3).
