IANA Registry Updates for TLS and DTLS
Abstract
This document updates the changes to the TLS and DTLS IANA registries made in RFC 8447. It
adds a new value, ""D"" for discouraged, to the ""Recommended"" column of the selected TLS
registries and adds a ""Comment"" column to all active registries that do not already have a
""Comment"" column. Finally, it updates the registration request instructions.
This document updates RFC 8447.
