6.3. Monitoring
For monitoring the operation of RNFD, its implementation  provide the following
information about a node:
whether the protocol is active, and
whether LORS is ""GLOBALLY DOWN"".
This information  be accompanied by the monitoring parameters defined by RPL ,
including at least the DODAG Version Number and the Rank. To offer even finer-grained
visibility into RNFD's state at the node, the implementation  also provide:
the assigned role (i.e., Sentinel or Acceptor),
the exact value of LORS (i.e., ""UP"", ""SUSPECTED DOWN"", ""LOCALLY DOWN"", or ""GLOBALLY
DOWN""),
