Abstract
This document updates RFC 7252 by modifying the registration procedures for the ""CoAP
Content-Formats"" IANA registry, within the ""Constrained RESTful Environments (CoRE)
Parameters"" registry group. This document also introduces a new column, ""Media Type"", to the
registry. Furthermore, this document reserves Content-Format identifiers 64998 and 64999 for
use in documentation.
