4.1.5. P-DAO Request
The set of RPL Control Messages is Extended to include the P-DAO-REQ and PDR-ACK. These two
new RPL Control Messages enable a RAN to request the establishment of a Track between itself
(as the Track ingress Node) and a Track egress. The node makes its request by sending a new P-
DAO-REQ message to the Root. The Root confirms with a new PDR-ACK message back to the
requester RAN; see Section 5.1 for more.
