3.1. Discovery by Resource Type
For discovery of the DoC resource through a link mechanism that allows describing a resource
type (e.g., the Resource Type attribute in ), this document introduces the resource type
""core.dns"". It can be used to identify a generic DNS resolver that is available to the client.
