4.2.3. Example
The following example illustrates the usage of a CoAP message to resolve ""example.org. IN
AAAA"" based on the URI ""coaps://[2001:db8::1]/"". The CoAP body is encoded in the ""application/
dns-message"" Content-Format.
FETCH coaps://[2001:db8::1]/
Content-Format: 553 (application/dns-message)
Accept: 553 (application/dns-message)
