5.3. Mapping DoC to DoH
This document provides no specification on how to map between DoC and DoH, e.g., at a CoAP-to-
HTTP proxy. Such a direct mapping is : Rewriting the FETCH method (Section
4.2) and TTL (Section 4.3.2) as specified in this document would be non-trivial. It is 
 to use a DNS forwarder to map between DoC and DoH, as would be the case for
mapping between any other pair of DNS transports.
